          In This Guide
        </h2>
        <nav class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
          <a href="#choose-your-method-by-stain" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">1. Choose Your Method by Stain Age</a>
          <a href="#method-1-cat-litter-fresh" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">2. Method 1: Cat Litter (Fresh Stains Only)</a>
