          <a href="#method-7-microbial-enzyme-cleaners" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">8. Method 7: Microbial / Enzyme Cleaners</a>
          <a href="#method-comparison" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">9. Method Comparison</a>
          <a href="#oil-stains-on-asphalt-vs" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">10. Oil Stains on Asphalt vs Concrete: Key Differences</a>
          <a href="#when-professional-help-makes-sense" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">11. When Professional Help Makes Sense</a>
          <a href="#the-honest-bottom-line" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">12. The Honest Bottom Line</a>
          <a href="#safety-considerations-when-cleaning-driveways" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">13. Safety Considerations When Cleaning Driveways</a>
          <a href="#faq" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">14. FAQ</a>
